WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.772 --> 00:00:16.074
couldn't wait to ask Ray about the coffee truck.

2
00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:18.796
But first she had some apologies to make.

3
00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:22.859
Outside the mayor's office, she called Kate.

4
00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:27.102
"I have to tell you something," Ally said.

5
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:29.224
"I didn't lose my phone.

6
00:00:30.344 --> 00:00:33.506
I just didn't want you asking to see my phone all the time.

7
00:00:34.586 --> 00:00:36.427
I'm so sorry I fibbed!"

8
00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:37.808
Kate was quiet.

9
00:00:39.009 --> 00:00:42.711
Ally was scared that Kate was mad, but then Kate laughed.

10
00:00:43.431 --> 00:00:46.032
"I get it.

11
00:00:46.553 --> 00:00:49.494
I don't like it when friends keep asking to borrow my clothes.

12
00:00:50.015 --> 00:00:51.435
I promise to stop asking.

13
00:00:51.956 --> 00:00:54.997
And I'll put up signs to find the other phone's owner."

14
00:00:55.017 --> 00:00:57.499
"Great!" Ally said.

15
00:00:57.519 --> 00:00:59.900
"Also, can you help me with something?"

16
00:01:00.796 --> 00:01:04.699
"Sure!" Ally told Kate about the surprise Holly Days party.

17
00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:06.160
"It's tonight.

18
00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.582
Can you make sure Mateo comes home at exactly six?"

19
00:01:10.282 --> 00:01:11.343
"No problem!"

20
00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:14.265
Ally got Julius' number from Kate.

21
00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:18.968
Then she called him to apologize for hurting his feelings twice.

22
00:01:18.988 --> 00:01:23.291
"It's been a rough week, but I'd really like to be friends.

23
00:01:23.892 --> 00:01:24.832
Can you forgive me?"

24
00:01:26.153 --> 00:01:27.614
Julius stayed quiet too.

25
00:01:29.035 --> 00:01:31.109
"He hates me," Ally thought.

26
00:01:31.129 --> 00:01:34.131
"I understand," Julius said softly.

27
00:01:34.151 --> 00:01:35.491
"Thanks for telling me."

28
00:01:36.772 --> 00:01:39.594
Ally told Julius about the party and invited him.

29
00:01:39.614 --> 00:01:41.275
"See you then!"

30
00:01:41.616 --> 00:01:42.336
Julius said.

31
00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:49.101
"I'll make my next apology in person," Ally thought, heading to the diner.

32
00:01:53.143 --> 00:01:54.244
Ray was in the office.

33
00:01:54.264 --> 00:01:55.605
"Hi, Ally!

34
00:01:56.085 --> 00:01:57.947
I was just thinking about that surprise party.

35
00:01:58.747 --> 00:01:59.688
I'll need to order food.

36
00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.425
Do you know what menu they want?"

37
00:02:01.445 --> 00:02:06.006
"Uh, Ray, there is no surprise party.

38
00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:07.927
At least not here.

39
00:02:08.447 --> 00:02:11.109
Barry was helping me plan something for Mateo.

40
00:02:11.949 --> 00:02:17.871
I wanted to explain, but you were on the phone and Ray looked confused, but he nodded.

41
00:02:18.652 --> 00:02:19.812
"Okay, no big deal.

42
00:02:21.533 --> 00:02:23.213
But why are you throwing Mateo a party?

43
00:02:23.694 --> 00:02:24.734
It's not his birthday."

44
00:02:24.754 --> 00:02:29.076
"I wanted to do something nice for him before I go to space."

45
00:02:30.012 --> 00:02:31.313
Ally explained her idea.

46
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:34.114
"It's just a few friends coming over tonight.

47
00:02:34.614 --> 00:02:35.375
Is that okay?"

48
00:02:35.395 --> 00:02:40.137
"Sure." "I have another exciting thing to ask you."

49
00:02:40.917 --> 00:02:42.478
Ally told Ray about her idea.

50
00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:51.202
coffee food truck sounds great, but I don't have anyone who can run it," Ray said.

51
00:02:51.222 --> 00:02:53.383
"Oh yes you do!"

52
00:02:53.804 --> 00:02:54.284
Ally said.

53
00:03:00.368 --> 00:03:03.591
Ally was decorating for the Holly Days party when the doorbell rang.

54
00:03:11.198 --> 00:03:12.459
it looks great in here!"

55
00:03:12.799 --> 00:03:14.481
Barry said, carrying in food.

56
00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:20.146
"Thanks!" Soon everything was laid out on the table.

57
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.129
"Great job, Barry.

58
00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:25.811
It looks delicious!"

59
00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.161
"Your mixed-up menu was fun to make," Barry said.

60
00:03:31.181 --> 00:03:33.421
"I hope Ray likes it too."

61
00:03:33.441 --> 00:03:36.102
"Me too," Ally said.

62
00:03:36.122 --> 00:03:39.243
"I can't wait for Mateo and everyone to get here."

63
00:03:40.203 --> 00:03:41.404
Soon the front door opened.

64
00:03:41.944 --> 00:03:46.345
In came Ray, Flo, Kate, Bethany, Julius, and Mateo.

65
00:03:46.365 --> 00:03:49.286
"Happy Holly Days!"

66
00:03:49.766 --> 00:03:50.386
Ally cried.

67
00:03:50.406 --> 00:03:54.127
"Wow!" Mateo looked around.

68
00:03:54.147 --> 00:03:57.808
"You remembered how much I love the holidays!"

69
00:03:58.876 --> 00:04:03.919
"Yes! And now, I don't have to miss any when I go to—uh, space!"

70
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.020
Ally said.

71
00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:09.443
"I can't believe you did all this on your own," Mateo said.

72
00:04:09.463 --> 00:04:12.285
"Barry helped," Ally said.

73
00:04:12.305 --> 00:04:15.767
"We planned the menu together, but he cooked everything."

74
00:04:15.787 --> 00:04:22.252
"Oh! The menu is surprising, but it looks delicious!"

75
00:04:22.692 --> 00:04:23.152
Ray said.

76
00:04:24.553 --> 00:04:25.734
Ally pulled Ray aside.

77
00:04:25.754 --> 00:04:28.376
"What do you think about my food truck idea now?"

78
00:04:29.036 --> 00:04:29.617
"I agree!

79
00:04:30.037 --> 00:04:31.999
Let's ask Barry to run it," Ray said.

80
00:04:32.019 --> 00:04:34.421
"Thanks to you, I see he's a good cook."

81
00:04:35.401 --> 00:04:36.102
Ally beamed.

82
00:04:36.742 --> 00:04:41.066
"Soon I'll be telling my parents all about my good deeds," she thought.

83
00:04:41.086 --> 00:04:43.508
"Everyone, dig in!"

84
00:04:43.908 --> 00:04:44.469
Ally called.

85
00:04:45.289 --> 00:04:48.572
She started to fill her own plate with food when her phone buzzed.

86
00:04:49.533 --> 00:04:50.153
It was Lainie.

87
00:04:50.173 --> 00:04:55.778
"I'm calling to tell you some news, Ally.

88
00:04:56.278 --> 00:04:57.900
I'm canceling the launch."

89
00:04:58.628 --> 00:05:00.910
"What?" Ally's heart sank.

90
00:05:02.251 --> 00:05:04.452
"You were right," Lainie said.

91
00:05:04.472 --> 00:05:11.017
"Saving endangered species is a much better use of my money than exploring space.

92
00:05:11.997 --> 00:05:14.839
So, I'm investing in a wildlife refuge.

93
00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.401
Gotta go!

94
00:05:17.421 --> 00:05:21.204
Bye!" "Oh no," Ally thought.

95
00:05:21.224 --> 00:05:27.548
"I was so close to going back home, and now She stood there, trying not to cry.

96
00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:29.925
Then someone hurried to her side.

97
00:05:29.945 --> 00:05:31.987
"Ally, are you all right?"

98
00:05:32.407 --> 00:05:33.288
Julius asked.

99
00:05:34.188 --> 00:05:35.509
Ally blinked back tears.

100
00:05:35.529 --> 00:05:39.091
"Lainie canceled the launch!"

101
00:05:40.272 --> 00:05:42.274
"I'm so sorry," Julius said.

102
00:05:47.097 --> 00:05:52.861
um, know this isn't as cool as going to space, but would you maybe want to go to

103
00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:54.082
the movies with me sometime?"

104
00:05:54.102 --> 00:05:57.144
"I'd love to!"

105
00:05:57.628 --> 00:05:58.429
Ally burst out.

106
00:05:59.229 --> 00:06:01.670
Julius grinned at her, and she smiled back.

107
00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:05.172
"It's not all bad news," she thought.

108
00:06:05.192 --> 00:06:09.634
"Because of me, Lainie is going to save endangered species.

109
00:06:10.755 --> 00:06:12.936
I get to spend more time with my friends.

110
00:06:14.197 --> 00:06:17.859
And I have a movie date—with a very cute Earthling!"
